Package: wav2textgrid
Title: Create TextGrids from Wav Files
Version: 0.0.6
Authors@R:
    person("Tyson", "Barrett", , "t.barrett88@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Allows the direct usage of open source tools including OpenAI's Whisper
    model, to create a transcribed textgrid for Wav files. It is designed to work
    with conversations with two individuals with two channels in the wav file
    (one tier per channel) as well as single channel (mono) wav files, which
    produce a single tier TextGrid. It is built on a set of Python scripts run
    in R using the `reticulate` package. As such, code can pulled and run
    directly in Python as well.
Imports:
    reticulate (>= 1.41.0),
    dplyr,
    tidyr,
